  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, heat the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64052f2eb4a1f25a09026efe/step-3dd8f1f2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a shallow bowl, place Mumbai spice blend. In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg. In a third shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs.\n• Dip haloumi into spice blend, followed by egg, and finally in panko breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64052f2eb4a1f25a09026efe/step-486d21a8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 minutes each side. Set aside on a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: Add extra oil if needed so the crumbed haloumi doesn't stick to the pan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64052f2eb4a1f25a09026efe/step-60e52c04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato and baby spinach leaves. Grate carrot.\n• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Just before serving, add spinach, tomato and carrot, and toss to combine. TIP: Tossing the salad just before serving keeps the leaves crisp!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64052f2eb4a1f25a09026efe/step-ecfd035a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook tomato paste and mild curry paste, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in coconut milk, the brown sugar and a splash of water, until slightly reduced, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64052f2eb4a1f25a09026efe/step-856186ba.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice and salad between bowls. Top with Mumbai crumbed haloumi.\n• Spoon over mild coconut sauce. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64052f2eb4a1f25a09026efe/step-d834c813.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
